  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 14 * 1 * 15 * 75 * 21 = 30 .\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷, −, +, ×\n\nGiven: 14 * 1 * 15 * 75 * 21 = 30 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**14 ÷ 1**__ - 15 + 75 × 21 = 30 \n\n⇒ 14 - 15 + __**75 × 21**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 15 __**+ 15**75__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __1589 - 15__ = 30 \n\n⇒ 1574 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ×, ÷, +, −\n\nGiven: 14 * 1 * 15 * 75 * 21 = 30 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**14 × 1 ÷ 15**__ + 75 - 21 = 30 \n\n⇒ __0.93** + 75**__ - 21 = 30\n\n⇒ __75.93 – 21__ = 30\n\n⇒ 54.93 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) −, ×, +, ÷\n\nGiven: 14 * 1 * 15 * 75 * 21 = 30 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 14 - 1 × 15 + __**75 ÷ 21**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ 14 - __**1 × 15**__ + 3.58 = 30 \n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 15 __**+ 3.58**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ __17.58 - 15__ = 30\n\n⇒ 2.58 ≠ 30\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) −, ÷, ×, +**\n\nGiven: 14 * 1 * 15 * 75 * 21 = 30 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 14 - __**1 ÷ 15 × 75**__ + 21 = 30 \n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 5 __**+ 2**__1 = 30 \n\n⇒ __35 - 5__ = 30\n\n**⇒ 30 = 30**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
